# tui-main on Hyper-V's 1024x768 framebuffer.
size: 128x48
screen:
| microL4 terminal demo                                                                                                   128x48 |
|                                                                                                                                |
| ╭─ Menu ───────────────╮ ╔═ Overview ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗ |
| │ > 1 Overview         │ ║                                                                                                   ║ |
| │   2 Attributes       │ ║ A terminal emulator drawing on the GOP framebuffer, and this app inside it:                       ║ |
| │   3 Colours          │ ║ tui writes escape sequences, term parses them into its screen model and                           ║ |
| │   4 Boxes            │ ║ draws each cell that changed with an 8x16 font.                                                   ║ |
| │   5 Keys             │ ║                                                                                                   ║ |
| │   6 Quit             │ ║ Threads, by priority:                                                                             ║ |
| ╰──────────────────────╯ ║   root     255   builds every server, then waits for their reports                                ║ |
|                          ║   watch    255   ends the run if a server faults                                                  ║ |
|                          ║   uart     200   the COM1 driver                                                                  ║ |
|                          ║   console  150   clients' lines, the focus, and client 4's raw keys                               ║ |
|                          ║   term     125   the terminal, the only thread that maps the framebuffer                          ║ |
|                          ║   tui      100   this app, term's one client                                                      ║ |
|                          ║                                                                                                   ║ |
|                          ║ Terminal: 128 x 48 cells of 8 x 16 pixels, no scrollback                                          ║ |
|                          ║                                                                                                   ║ |
|                          ║ Keys: COM1, uart, console (client 4 is raw), term, tui.                                           ║ |
|                          ║ Ctrl-T 4 gives term the keyboard; Ctrl-T 1 gives it back to root.                                 ║ |
|                          ║                                                                                                   ║ |
|                          ║ Styles: bold faint underline inverse colour                                                       ║ |
